<title>INDIA: India RBI raises 17.7 bln rupees at 14-day auction.</title>
<headline>India RBI raises 17.7 bln rupees at 14-day auction.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it accepted bids for 17.72 billion rupees at an auction of 14-day treasury bills on Friday.</p>
<p>The total face value of the bills issued was 17.72 billion rupees. The cut-off rate was steady at 99.81 rupees.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
